y></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><i><b>Jazz à la Bohemia</b></i> (also released as <i><b>Greenwich Village Jazz</b></i>) is a <a href=\"/wiki/Live_album\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Live album\">live album</a> by American jazz pianist <a href=\"/wiki/Randy_Weston\" title=\"Randy Weston\">Randy Weston</a> recorded on October 14, 1956, at the <a href=\"/wiki/Caf%C3%A9_Bohemia\" title=\"Café Bohemia\">Café Bohemia</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Greenwich_Village\" title=\"Greenwich Village\">Greenwich Village</a> and released on <a href=\"/wiki/Riverside_Records\" title=\"Riverside Records\">Riverside</a> later that year.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Reception\">Reception</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Jazz_%C3%A0_la_Bohemia&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Reception\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable floatright\" style=\"width:24.2em;font-size:88%;text-align:center;margin:0.5em 0 0.5em 1em;padding:0;border-spacing:0\"><caption style=\"font-size:115%\">Professional ratings</caption><tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#202122;background:#d1dbdf;font-size:100%\">Review scores</th></tr><tr><th scope=\"col\">Source</th><th scope=\"col\">Rating</th></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><a href=\"/wiki/AllMusic\" title=\"AllMusic\">AllMusic</a></td><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\" title=\"4.5/5 stars\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"4.5/5 stars\"><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.